Z||000015||Fiero5||08-17-2001||12:17 AM||||"88CoupeV6 won a certificate for free stock floormats and a free membership from them at the OOB show and has not heard from or received anything from them yet. That was about 2 months ago. He sent the stuff in right away, too."<P>Don't hold your breath! I sent in over $100. a year and half ago for the club membership and the back issue special and nothing. The first contact I finally got was from Phil via e-mail about 7 months into waiting, who opologized and said it would be right out in about a week. Yeah, right. A few months later and still nothing. Then I reached Gloria a few months later who just argued with me and still nothing.<BR>It seems that as much good as they "might" be doing and have done for the Fiero community, they offset that and then some by also screwing over the same Fiero community.<P>You sent in your stuff about 2 months ago. Give it about a week for snail mail to get to California, and another week or so for it to get shipped back. Say a month to be safe, I think that's fair. 2 months? That's another story, or another story to add to all the other stories of people getting ripped off.<BR>As a suggestion, maybe contact Chris Schaefer or Tim Perrigo of FOCONE. As they are a chapter off of FOCOA who apparently supplied the door prizes and  may have their "ear" enough to maybe get your stuff sent. They weren't able to help me though, but it's a thought anyway.<P>Steve||||reg||4
